  OrchestratorAgent  (Claude 3 Haiku - fast routing, manages WorkflowState)
        │
   ┌────┼────────────────────┬────────────────────────┐
   │    │                    │                        │
InventoryAgent   PolicyAgent   RefundAgent  CommunicationAgent
(DynamoDB)    (Multi-Agent RAG)  (DynamoDB)   (composes response)
                    │
